    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Chuck, torque collar with readable detent numbers, trigger, belt clip and battery pack are all modelled, not textured on. Wireframe shows dense but even triangulation around the grip. The yellow plastic and black rubber read as distinct materials in every orbit view.",
    "limitations": [
      "Battery label reads 18V 1.3Ah LITHIUM-ION, a generic specification with no manufacturer mark.",
      "Chuck and trigger are static; no rig is included."
